@Customer_HostAddress = http://localhost:5176

### Create Allergen
POST {{Customer_HostAddress}}/allergens
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "GLUTEN",
    "name": "Gluten",
    "iconUrl": "https://example.com/icons/gluten.png",
    "isActive": true,
    "displayOrder": 1
}

###

